    "The four X01 discovery, selected-component, config-lifecycle, and transformer-chain observers are exact-byte-bound to the candidate epoch. Historical launches therefore retain healthy direct-application and Foundation final-definition evidence but cannot satisfy the five-family historical acceptance condition without separate multi-epoch observer versions.",
    "Detached unrelated-target experiments did achieve direct child-first application, but were rejected because unrelated targets cannot inherit the parent target's injected exercise method; they produced the same missing child/middle/leaf invocation pattern parent-first and child-first.",
    "No result in this report changes Matrix V1 or supports a general CleanMix, Cleanroom, Atlas, or consumer-mod compatibility claim."
  ],
